DESCRIPTION:[Polars](https://github.com/pola-rs/polars) is lightning fast\,
  easy to use\, dataframe library.\nIt's clean API and its contexts and exp
 ressions allow writing readable but performant data wrangling code.\n\nAim
 ed at both data newbies and pandas experts (Polars != pandas)\, in this ha
 nds-on tutorial we'll use data from the [Pokémon franchise](https://en.wi
 kipedia.org/wiki/Pokémon) to explore the Polars API and the ideas that se
 t it apart from pandas and other dataframe libraries.
